ied\n* `Salary` - Salary\n* `Hourly` - Hourly"},"location":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ContributionClassLocation","description":"Location matcher type.\n\n* `Unspecified` - Unspecified\n* `State` - State"},"location_value":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Location matcher value (CSV of state codes), or null."},"family_status":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CoverageTier","description":"Family-status matcher.\n\n* `Unspecified` - Unspecified\n* `EE` - Ee\n* `ES` - Es\n* `EC` - Ec\n* `EF` - Ef"},"min_age":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Age-band lower bound, or null."},"max_age":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Age-band upper bound, or null."}},"required":["contribution_class_id","amount_in_cents","employment","compensation","location","location_value","family_status","min_age","max_age"],"description":"One ICHRA contribution class, mirroring the internal configuration endpoint's\n``IchraContributionClassConfigurationEntitySerializer`` field-for-field. Two deliberate\ndifferences for the public surface: the identifier is the opaque prefixed ``iccl_*`` form rather\nthan a raw UUID, and the matcher choices come from the domain enums rather than the model's.","title":"_IchraContributionClass"},"_ContributionTier":{"type":"object","properties":{"benefit_plan_id":{"type":"string","description":"Prefixed benefit-plan identifier (`bpln_*`)."},"benefit_plan_name":{"type":"string","description":"Benefit plan name."},"benefit_plan_tier_name":{"type":"string","description":"Coverage-tier name."},"coverage_tier":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CoverageTier","description":"Coverage-tier code for this tier.\n\n* `Unspecified` - Unspecified\n* `EE` - Ee\n* `ES` - Es\n* `EC` - Ec\n* `EF` - Ef"},"cost":{"type":"integer","description":"Monthly employee deduction in cents."},"cost_per_dependent":{"type":"integer","description":"Monthly employee deduction per dependent, in cents."},"dependents_required_in":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether dependents are r