ed to."},"agent_of_record":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CarrierApplicationAgentOfRecord","description":"The retained carrier attribution."},"statuses":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CarrierApplicationStatuses","description":"The four stable status axes."},"follow_up":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CarrierApplicationDetailFollowUp","description":"Whether and why someone must act, and what to fix."},"authorized_actions":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CarrierApplicationAuthorizedAction"},"description":"The actions this application currently permits, for this caller. `assign` is present only while the assignment endpoint would accept a change: not once processing has begun, not once the application is submitted, cancelled or terminal, not while an assignment change is already pending, and not for a caller that endpoint would refuse. `correction`, `supporting_document` and `submit` appear on the single-application response only, never on a queue row, and only while the carrier reports the action as available and no other provider action is in flight. `correction` is additionally absent once the application is submitted, effectuated, cancelled or terminated. `deeplink` is present only on a deeplink-routed application that has not yet been submitted and whose assigned agent has a HealthSherpa slug. `status_update` is present only while the caller can record status updates for the application."},"created_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"When the application was created."},"updated_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"When the application last changed."},"context":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CarrierApplicationQueueContext","description":"Who and what the application is about."},"current_residential_address":{"type":["object","null"],"additionalProperties":{"type":"string"}},"editable_carrier_questions":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CarrierQuestion"}},"effective_carrier_question_respon